      <div class="editor flex lazy-editor" style=""><pre tabindex="0" class="lazy-virtualized" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 19px;"><pre class="lazy-gutter"></pre><pre class="monaco-colorized colab colab" data-lang="notebook-python"><span><span class="mtk1">numerical_features&nbsp;=&nbsp;[</span><span class="mtk21">'Survived'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">'Age'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">'Fare'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">'SibSp'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">'Parch'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">'Pclass'</span><span class="mtk1">]</span></span><br><span><span></span></span><br><span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Calculate&nbsp;the&nbsp;pairwise&nbsp;correlation&nbsp;between&nbsp;selec</span><span class="mtk8">ted&nbsp;numerical&nbsp;features.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;The&nbsp;.corr()&nbsp;method&nbsp;computes&nbsp;the&nbsp;standard&nbsp;correla</span><span class="mtk8">tion&nbsp;coefficient.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">correlation_matrix&nbsp;=&nbsp;df[numerical_features].corr()</span></span><br><span><span></span></span><br><span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Create&nbsp;a&nbsp;heatmap&nbsp;to&nbsp;visualize&nbsp;the&nbsp;correlation&nbsp;ma</span><span class="mtk8">trix.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">plt.figure(figsize=(</span><span class="mtk12">10</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk12">8</span><span class="mtk1">))&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Set&nbsp;the&nbsp;size&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;plot&nbsp;for&nbsp;optimal&nbsp;readability</span><span class="mtk8">.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">sns.heatmap(correlation_matrix,</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;annot=</span><span class="mtk6">True</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Display&nbsp;the&nbsp;correlation&nbsp;coefficients&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;heat</span><span class="mtk8">map&nbsp;cells.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;cmap=</span><span class="mtk21">'coolwarm'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Use&nbsp;a&nbsp;diverging&nbsp;colormap&nbsp;('coolwarm'&nbsp;shows&nbsp;posit</span><span class="mtk8">ive/negative&nbsp;correlations).</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;fmt=</span><span class="mtk21">'.2f'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Format&nbsp;the&nbsp;annotations&nbsp;to&nbsp;two&nbsp;decimal&nbsp;places.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;linewidths=</span><span class="mtk12">.5</span><span class="mtk1">)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Add&nbsp;lines&nbsp;between&nbsp;cells&nbsp;for&nbsp;better&nbsp;visual&nbsp;separa</span><span class="mtk8">tion.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">plt.title(</span><span class="mtk21">'Correlation&nbsp;Heatmap&nbsp;of&nbsp;Numerical&nbsp;Features'</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;fontsize=</span><span class="mtk12">16</span><span class="mtk1">)&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Set&nbsp;a&nbsp;descriptive&nbsp;chart&nbsp;title.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">plt.xticks(rotation=</span><span class="mtk12">45</span><span class="mtk1">,&nbsp;ha=</span><span class="mtk21">'right'</span><span class="mtk1">)&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Rotate&nbsp;x-axis&nbsp;labels&nbsp;for&nbsp;better&nbsp;legibility.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">plt.yticks(rotation=</span><span class="mtk12">0</span><span class="mtk1">)&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Ensure&nbsp;y-axis&nbsp;labels&nbsp;are&nbsp;horizontal.</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk1">plt.show()&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk8">#&nbsp;Display&nbsp;the&nbsp;generated&nbsp;plot.</span></span><br><span><span></span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"\n---&nbsp;Interpretation&nbsp;---"</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"The&nbsp;heatmap&nbsp;visually&nbsp;represents&nbsp;the&nbsp;strength&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">direction&nbsp;of&nbsp;linear&nbsp;relationships&nbsp;between&nbsp;numerica</span><span class="mtk21">l&nbsp;variables.&nbsp;Values&nbsp;range&nbsp;from&nbsp;-1&nbsp;(strong&nbsp;negative</span><span class="mtk21">&nbsp;correlation)&nbsp;to&nbsp;+1&nbsp;(strong&nbsp;positive&nbsp;correlation),</span><span class="mtk21">&nbsp;with&nbsp;0&nbsp;indicating&nbsp;no&nbsp;linear&nbsp;correlation."</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"\n---&nbsp;Key&nbsp;Relationships&nbsp;Revealed&nbsp;---"</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**'Fare'&nbsp;and&nbsp;'Survived'&nbsp;(0.19)**:&nbsp;There&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">moderate&nbsp;positive&nbsp;correlation,&nbsp;suggesting&nbsp;that&nbsp;pas</span><span class="mtk21">sengers&nbsp;who&nbsp;paid&nbsp;higher&nbsp;fares&nbsp;had&nbsp;a&nbsp;somewhat&nbsp;bette</span><span class="mtk21">r&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;survival."</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**'Pclass'&nbsp;and&nbsp;'Survived'&nbsp;(-0.11)**:&nbsp;A&nbsp;weak&nbsp;n</span><span class="mtk21">egative&nbsp;correlation&nbsp;exists,&nbsp;indicating&nbsp;that&nbsp;lower&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">passenger&nbsp;class&nbsp;(e.g.,&nbsp;3rd&nbsp;class,&nbsp;which&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;high</span><span class="mtk21">er&nbsp;numerical&nbsp;value)&nbsp;is&nbsp;associated&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;slightly&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">lower&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;survival.&nbsp;This&nbsp;aligns&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;'hi</span><span class="mtk21">gher&nbsp;class,&nbsp;higher&nbsp;survival'&nbsp;expectation."</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**'Age'&nbsp;and&nbsp;'Survived'&nbsp;(0.01)**:&nbsp;A&nbsp;very&nbsp;weak&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">positive&nbsp;correlation,&nbsp;suggesting&nbsp;age&nbsp;alone&nbsp;has&nbsp;lit</span><span class="mtk21">tle&nbsp;linear&nbsp;relationship&nbsp;with&nbsp;survival.&nbsp;This&nbsp;might&nbsp;</span><span class="mtk21">change&nbsp;when&nbsp;considering&nbsp;interactions&nbsp;with&nbsp;other&nbsp;va</span><span class="mtk21">riables."</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**'Fare'&nbsp;and&nbsp;'Pclass'&nbsp;(-0.58)**:&nbsp;A&nbsp;strong&nbsp;neg</span><span class="mtk21">ative&nbsp;correlation,&nbsp;indicating&nbsp;that&nbsp;higher&nbsp;fares&nbsp;ar</span><span class="mtk21">e&nbsp;associated&nbsp;with&nbsp;lower&nbsp;passenger&nbsp;classes&nbsp;(e.g.,&nbsp;1</span><span class="mtk21">st&nbsp;class,&nbsp;which&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;lower&nbsp;numerical&nbsp;value).&nbsp;This</span><span class="mtk21">&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;expected&nbsp;relationship&nbsp;as&nbsp;higher&nbsp;classes&nbsp;gen</span><span class="mtk21">erally&nbsp;cost&nbsp;more."</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**'Age'&nbsp;and&nbsp;'Pclass'&nbsp;(-0.47)**:&nbsp;A&nbsp;moderate&nbsp;ne</span><span class="mtk21">gative&nbsp;correlation,&nbsp;implying&nbsp;that&nbsp;passengers&nbsp;in&nbsp;hi</span><span class="mtk21">gher&nbsp;classes&nbsp;tend&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;older&nbsp;on&nbsp;average,&nbsp;or&nbsp;conve</span><span class="mtk21">rsely,&nbsp;lower&nbsp;class&nbsp;passengers&nbsp;are&nbsp;generally&nbsp;younge</span><span class="mtk21">r."</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br><span><span class="mtk15">print</span><span class="mtk1">(</span><span class="mtk21">"Overall,&nbsp;the&nbsp;heatmap&nbsp;confirms&nbsp;expected&nbsp;relationsh</span><span class="mtk21">ips&nbsp;and&nbsp;highlights&nbsp;that&nbsp;'Fare'&nbsp;and&nbsp;'Pclass'&nbsp;have&nbsp;t</span><span class="mtk21">he&nbsp;most&nbsp;substantial&nbsp;linear&nbsp;associations&nbsp;with&nbsp;'Surv</span><span class="mtk21">ived'&nbsp;among&nbsp;the&nbsp;numerical&nbsp;features."</span><span class="mtk1">)</span></span><br></pre><colab-read-only-cell-placeholder style="display: none;"><template shadowmode="open"><!----><div><!--?lit$192613175$-->Start coding or <span tabindex="0" role="button" class="link">generate</span> with AI.</div></template></colab-read-only-cell-placeholder></pre></div><colab-form class="formview vertical layout flex"><div class="widget-area"></div></colab-form></div>
